<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3443] Incorrect regex for &apos;DESCRIBE MATERIALIZED VIEW&apos; in CQL Interpreter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3443</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Almost all regular expressions, except for &lt;tt&gt;DESCRIBE MATERIALIZED VIEW&lt;/tt&gt; in the CQL interpreter allow to have an optional space before closing &lt;tt&gt;;&lt;/tt&gt; character.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There is some code that uses these spaces before &lt;tt&gt;;&lt;/tt&gt; character, so the command fails when you copy/past commands.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ll send PR to fix this trivial problem&lt;/p&gt;</description>
