&lt;p&gt;    Almost all regular expressions, except for DESCRIBE MATERIALIZED VIEW in the CQL interpreter allow to have an optional space before closing ; character.  There is some code that uses these spaces before ; character, so the command fails when you copy/past commands.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This PR fixes it&lt;/p&gt;

